      "content": "10.1 British Rule in Odisha"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Modern Period in Odisha's history covers British rule and the subsequent freedom movement.",
        "The historic Paika Rebellion broke out in 1817 as a major early rebellion against British colonial rule.",
        "Tribal Uprisings and key leaders such as Veer Surendra Sai played vital roles in resisting foreign authority.",
        "Sustained efforts by prominent freedom fighters led to the establishment of Odisha as a separate province."
      ],
